  "reason": "The assistant provides specific factual claims about French labor law (duration of salary payment during illness based on seniority) that directly contradict the provided reference text (which specifies 3 weeks in the first year of service and longer later, not 9 or 30 days). The assistant invents details not present in the reference and presents them as general rules, which constitutes a significant factual error.",
